{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20182","headline":"憩淮上观公法堂 · 孟郊","name":"憩淮上观公法堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"动觉日月短，静知时岁长。\n自悲道路人，暂宿空闲堂。\n孤烛让清昼，纱巾歛辉光。\n高僧积素行，事外无刚强。\n我有岩下桂，愿爲炉中香。\n不惜青翠姿，爲君扬芬芳。\n淮水色不污，汴流徒浑黄。\n且将琉璃意，净缀芙蓉章。\n明日还独行，羇愁来旧肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20182.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20182","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}